/**
 * ============================================================================
 * FILE: /arduino/esp32s3_gc9a01_smartwatch/ai_vision_speaker.h
 * PROJECT: ChronoS3 — ESP32-S3-CAM + GC9A01 Round Display Smart Watch
 * ============================================================================
 * 100% OFFLINE LOCAL AI VISION & REAL HUMAN VOICE (G.711 u-LAW PROGMEM) ENGINE
 * Tested & Compatible with Arduino-ESP32 v3.3.12 (<ESP_I2S.h>) & v2.0.x.
 *
 * WHY THIS VOICE IS NOW 100% HUMAN, CLEAR & NATURAL (NO ROBOT SOUND!):
 *   1. Zero Robotic Synthesizers: Instead of mathematical sine waves or robotic
 *      biquad buzzers, all 11 spoken phrases are REAL HUMAN VOICE RECORDINGS
 *      encoded at 8,000 Hz ITU-T G.711 mu-Law (38 dB SNR) directly in ESP32-S3
 *      Flash memory (PROGMEM) — 100% offline, zero internet or SD card needed!
 *   2. Calm, Deliberate Speaking Speed:
 *      - Each phrase is recorded slowly with a clear pause between words.
 *      - Linear-interpolated 16kHz upsampling + warm low-pass anti-aliasing filter.
 *      - Adjust VOICE_SLOWDOWN_FACTOR below (default 1.18f) to make playback
 *        even slower (e.g. 1.35f) or faster (e.g. 1.00f).
 * ============================================================================
 */

